hvigorw needs JAVA_HOME=/Applications/DevEco-Studio.app/Contents/jbr/Contents/Home (no system Java; PackageHap fails otherwise). Install with `hdc -t 127.0.0.1:5555 install -r`.

Emulator DNS can't resolve jingmo CDN, so 设置→同步数据 fails. 设置→导入数据 works: dataset JSONs pushed to /storage/media/100/local/files/Docs/Download/ (jm_poem_v3_1.json, jm_sentence_v3_1.json) as of 2026-10-17.

